  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFRICAN FRAGILITY INITITIAVE IFC PARTNERSHIP PROG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AFI is a 5-year advisory/upstream effort to support the growth and development of private sector development (PSD) across 32 fragile African countries and is IFC&#x2019;s expanded fragility and conflict-affected states (FCS) initiative. This programme is in line with our focus in advancing the Humanitarian-Development-Peace nexus approach. AFI incorporates gender considerations into projects and a significant crosscutting theme of female empowerment through economic initiatives. &#xa0;This is the third year of the AFI programme. A mid-term review of the AFI programme is scheduled in 2024, in accordance with the DAC principles.</narrative>
  </description>
